  "solution": {
    "text": "At logic gate-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>, the Boolean expression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></menclose><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>'</mo></math><br /><br />At logic gate-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>, the Boolean expression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><menclose notation=\"top\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></menclose><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></math><br /><br />At logic gate-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>III</mi></math>, the Boolean expression is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math>",
